# Cici, Buoyant Performer

> Cici is not the EXP pick you lock for a flashy duel. She is the fighter you choose when the enemy has to keep walking into you, because every extra second they stay attached to her yo-yo turns into a losing trade. Patch 2.2.16 ([patch notes](/patch-notes)) raised the spell vamp per Delight stack and sharpened Yo-Yo Blitz against high-HP units and early creeps, so her lane clears faster and her long fights are harder to outlast.

